  <Task>
    <Title>Uninstall Microsoft Lync 2010 Attendee - 32 bit</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[    Standard Uninstallation Fixlet Template.  See the Uninstall Wizard for details related to this fixlet.
    <P><B>Source Wizard:</B> <A href="http://bigfix.me/uninstall">http://bigfix.me/uninstall</A></P>
    <P>This fixlet is constructed from the following variables provided by the developer:</P>
    <P><B>Registry Source:</B> HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall</P>
    <P><B>Display Name:</B> Microsoft Lync 2010 Attendee</P>
    <P><B>Application Guid:</B> 6F72D695-5188-4484-B21E-E16CD89C4008</P>
    <P><B>Uninstall Command String:</B> MsiExec.exe /x{appGuid} /quiet /norestart</P>
]]></Description>
    <Relevance>name of operating system starts with &quot;Win&quot;</Relevance>
    <Relevance>if exists property &quot;in proxy agent context&quot; then ( not in proxy agent context ) else true</Relevance>
    <Relevance>exists key whose (value &quot;DisplayName&quot; of it as string contains &quot;Microsoft Lync 2010 Attendee&quot; AND value &quot;UninstallString&quot; of it as string as lowercase contains &quot;msiexec&quot;) of key &quot;HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall&quot; of registry</Relevance>
    <Category>Uninstall</Category>
    <Source>mel</Source>
    <SourceID>&lt;Unspecified&gt;</SourceID>
    <SourceReleaseDate>2012-12-06</SourceReleaseDate>
    <SourceSeverity>&lt;Unspecified&gt;</SourceSeverity>
    <MIMEField>
      <Name>x-fixlet-modification-time</Name>
      <Value>Thu, 6 Dec 2012 12:28:480</Value>
    </MIMEField>
    <Domain>BESC</Domain>
    <DefaultAction ID="Action1">
      <Description>
        <PreLink>Click </PreLink>
        <Link>here</Link>
        <PostLink> to uninstall this software.</PostLink>
      </Description>
      <ActionScript MIMEType="application/x-Fixlet-Windows-Shell">//User Defined Uninstall String
waithidden MsiExec.exe /x{{6F72D695-5188-4484-B21E-E16CD89C4008} /quiet /norestart
</ActionScript>
      <SuccessCriteria Option="OriginalRelevance"></SuccessCriteria>
    </DefaultAction>
    <Action ID="Action956">
